          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147060,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens if we apply the <code>display: flex</code> property on a UI panel that is already an item inside a flex HUD?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It becomes a flex container in addition to being the flex child of its parent container</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It gets reset to <code>display: block</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It doesn't get reset</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It becomes a flex container in addition to being the flex child of its parent container.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147061,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Is the <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> element a flexbox parent or a flexbox child?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;hud&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Score\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"1200\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\".hud\" class=\"selector-class\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": flex;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">In this case, the <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> element is a flexbox child</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">In this case, the <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> element is a flexbox parent</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> element is not affected in any way</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">In this case, the <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> element is a flexbox child.</p></body></html>"
          },
