          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147065,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we control whether the HUD items will line up horizontally or vertically?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Using the <code>flex-direction</code> property</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Using the <code>flex-axis</code> property</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">We can't control it</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Using the <code>flex-direction</code> property.</p></body></html>"
